# Store text as LF in the repository and in the working copy. This pack is pure
# Python/JSON/Markdown, and ComfyUI servers are overwhelmingly Linux, so CRLF
# translations would only add noise (and git warns about them on every add).
#
# This file is load-bearing on Windows: the system-level config here sets
# core.autocrlf=true, which would otherwise rewrite every LF file to CRLF on
# checkout and emit a warning on every add.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, should any be added later. The skills/ directory makes a .png
# or .safetensors plausible (Agent Skills bundles may ship assets/), so these
# rules are not speculative.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.safetensors binary
